# GATED — phase 6 of docs/authentik-active-active/PLAN.md.
#
# keepalived.conf in this directory references the VRRP password record that
# stacks/system mints (authentik-vip.ts). The merge that adds this stack also
# triggers that system run, and nothing orders the two: if stacks/home renders
# first, the missing reference aborts the ENTIRE stacks/home run (HO#636).
#
# Delete this file once:
#   1. `bao kv get secrets/clusters/equestria/apps/authentik-vip/vrrp` returns
#      a value;
#   2. authentik-server publishes 127.0.0.1:9000 on dockge-as (same phase-6
#      change -- `ss -ltn | grep 127.0.0.1:9000` on the LXC). Without it the
#      health check fails and this instance sits in FAULT, which is safe but
#      useless;
#   3. the equestria DaemonSet (network/authentik-vip) is running, so the VIP
#      has a priority-150 holder and this instance starts as the backup it is
#      meant to be.
